sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant DownloadMgr as Download Manager
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant DRM as DRM License Service
    participant CDN
    participant Storage as Secure Local Storage

    User->>DownloadMgr: Request Download (title_id)
    DownloadMgr->>Auth: Validate Entitlement
    Auth-->>DownloadMgr: Entitlement OK
    DownloadMgr->>DRM: Request Offline License
    DRM-->>DownloadMgr: Offline License (device-bound)
    DownloadMgr->>Storage: Store License in Secure Storage
    DownloadMgr->>CDN: Fetch Encrypted Segments
    CDN-->>DownloadMgr: Encrypted Segments
    DownloadMgr->>Storage: Write Encrypted Content
    DownloadMgr-->>User: Download Complete

    Note over User,Storage: Offline Playback (no network required)
    User->>DownloadMgr: Play Offline Title
    DownloadMgr->>Storage: Load License + Content
    Storage-->>DownloadMgr: Decryption Keys + Segments
    DownloadMgr-->>User: Secure Playback Begins
